      "full_text" : "@nadavwiz It's a trade-off between downside protection and upside.\n\nWith liquidation prefs, exits roughly go:\n1. Everyone loses\n2. Late-stage recoups; others get nothing\n3. Late-stage recoups; founders/early investors win\n4. Everyone wins\n\nAirtable just happened to land at #3.",
