      "full_text" : "@RgtShahar @Yampeleg Ability to exploit the policy semantically would be an implementation bug, it's not inherent in the design. Similar to XSS.\n\nDon't confuse what we have right now with what can be done when systems are properly designed.",
      "lang" : "en",
