      "full_text" : "@RgtShahar @Yampeleg I lost you there.\n\nEvery organization has some policy re who can access what, and this policy is semantic to begin with: \"only HR can access employee salaries\".\n\nImplementations like \"only HR can access the team salaries folder\" were only due to inability to enforce semantically.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "ThatsShahar",
